  "question": {
    "text": "The first, second and seventh terms of an arithmetic progression (all the terms are distinct) are in geometric progression and the sum of these three terms is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>93</mn></math>. Then, the fourth term of this geometric progression is"
